{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/cd6292c34e9142c263aecb65fdc1f234.poster.avif?t=1756035732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/cd6292c34e9142c263aecb65fdc1f234.webm?t=1756035732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/cd6292c34e9142c263aecb65fdc1f234.mp4?t=1756035732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and a friend drive deep into the Empty Quarter \u2014 one of the most remote deserts on Earth. People say it\u2019s the perfect place to clear your thoughts, to escape the noise of everyday life. But the farther you go, the quieter it becomes\u2026 <strong>until the silence becomes unsettling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/268708bceb05e5317871d34e073ca17e.poster.avif?t=1756035732\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/268708bceb05e5317871d34e073ca17e.webm?t=1756035732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/268708bceb05e5317871d34e073ca17e.mp4?t=1756035732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration, off-road driving(be careful not to get stuck in the sand), and conversation mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off-road Driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging storyline inspired by Arabic culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 minutes - 1 hour of gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897960?t=1756035732","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897960?t=1756035732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/bc1b5918acb7d70d0c36861a70b57e196d35d419/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756035732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/bc1b5918acb7d70d0c36861a70b57e196d35d419/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756035732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/cd6292c34e9142c263aecb65fdc1f234.poster.avif?t=1756035732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/cd6292c34e9142c263aecb65fdc1f234.webm?t=1756035732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/cd6292c34e9142c263aecb65fdc1f234.mp4?t=1756035732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and a friend drive deep into the Empty Quarter \u2014 one of the most remote deserts on Earth. People say it\u2019s the perfect place to clear your thoughts, to escape the noise of everyday life. But the farther you go, the quieter it becomes\u2026 <strong>until the silence becomes unsettling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/268708bceb05e5317871d34e073ca17e.poster.avif?t=1756035732\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/268708bceb05e5317871d34e073ca17e.webm?t=1756035732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/extras/268708bceb05e5317871d34e073ca17e.mp4?t=1756035732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration, off-road driving(be careful not to get stuck in the sand), and conversation mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off-road Driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging storyline inspired by Arabic culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 minutes - 1 hour of gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Eucalypt"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897960/203ed4feab99960bb7b24971ebf6364c5b687bfb/header.jpg?t=1756035732","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897960/563168992/f475980a6e57b14277698fb4fce31b10969e7f95/1754051063/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754060428","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897960/563168992/f475980a6e57b14277698fb4fce31b10969e7f95/1754051063/dash_h264.mpd?t=